          deckDescription: 'The Cego pack used for Vier-Anderle has 38 cards: 22 tarocks (trump cards numbered 1 to 22, with Gstieß the highest) plus 16 suit cards in two colour groups. The suit cards are King, Queen, Knight, and Jack in each of the Black and Red suit groups. No jokers or extra cards.',
          suitDescription: 'Cego uses two colour-based suit groups (Black and Red), each with four court cards (King, Queen, Knight, Jack). The 22 tarocks do not belong to a suit; they form the trump series and outrank suit cards when played as trumps.',
